{"3314270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Planetary Delivery Boys", "steam_appid": 3314270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/729d3af433f1b0095427a779dd5ac0b4.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Planetary Delivery Boys</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op horror game about a delivery company that treats people as goods. Escort high-value cargo across a hostile galaxy aboard the automated Company Train, and arrive with <strong>something</strong> to deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wishlist now, the Company will notify you when onboarding opens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e7269bb149d850ff080b9391a7871df5.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e7269bb149d850ff080b9391a7871df5.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/38de630041b3f4009514c9052b6c1506.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Success requires teamwork, but survival requires cold statistics. To reach the destination safely, an <strong>IDS ASSET </strong>(that's you) must be ready to make the ultimate sacrifice. If power production stalls, do not hesitate to turn your <strong>colleagues into fuel</strong> to keep the train moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/24760e02aa8f44fffea24a72b118319f.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/24760e02aa8f44fffea24a72b118319f.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/86e1026311daaec0318d0b16958136e0.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As an <strong>IDS ASSET</strong> your journey may be difficult. The company has provided the following recommendations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Station</strong>: Invite friends, select destinations, spend credits on upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Transi</strong>t: Defend cargo, maintain shared power, decide who is expendable  <br><strong>The Ultimate Rule</strong>: Keep packages safe<u>,</u> <u>at all costs.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/43f980cab38cbc566974bcfc6f5a0f14.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/43f980cab38cbc566974bcfc6f5a0f14.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/fbb5973ae6d7f93fa0f307b2a7a3bb6b.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Maintaining the wagons is only half the battle; you must also survive the transit. Keep your equipment running, and be careful of what lurks in the vents...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/cb8a4e68aaf835a3581be9a4973f8137.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/cb8a4e68aaf835a3581be9a4973f8137.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/10cdc78d0cf7897d476b16783d48ac6d.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every light you flick, every door you seal drains the train's shared power. When it hits zero, all systems go dark, and every security door on the train slides open.  You don't want to be inside when that happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/fa64d577e144db8401f974266d8d656b.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/fa64d577e144db8401f974266d8d656b.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/ce10a1336b8fe2669e984ba313c2bee7.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every employee is issued a standard duty <strong>Multi-Tool </strong>for long range communication and fending off thieves. Your tools require juice, you can charge your<strong> Personal Battery </strong>by draining the train's power. Every charge you take for yourself, is a charge taken away from the train's defence systems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/a8d2b429eba21de52f223fc0ab3dbcf0.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/a8d2b429eba21de52f223fc0ab3dbcf0.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/a5f1511cb4cff3f42805d9db28b700e3.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span>The<strong> Planetary Delivery Boys</strong> is currently still in development. <strong>A free demo is on the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> Wishlist now, the company will notify you when your shift begins.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/729d3af433f1b0095427a779dd5ac0b4.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Planetary Delivery Boys</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op horror game about a delivery company that treats people as goods. Escort high-value cargo across a hostile galaxy aboard the automated Company Train, and arrive with <strong>something</strong> to deliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wishlist now, the Company will notify you when onboarding opens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e7269bb149d850ff080b9391a7871df5.poster.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/e7269bb149d850ff080b9391a7871df5.webm?t=1783964927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314270/extras/38de630041b3f4009514c9052b6c1506.avif?t=1783964927\" width=1560 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Success requires teamwork, but survival requires cold statistics. To reach the destination safely, an <strong>IDS ASSET </strong>(that's you) must be ready to make the ultimate sacrifice. If power production stalls, do not hesi